      ],
      "message": "contrib: add post-quantum signature tool (ML-DSA-65, liboqs)\n\nAdd an experimental standalone toolset in contrib/pq-shield implementing\nNIST FIPS 204 ML-DSA-65 (CRYSTALS-Dilithium Mode 3 equivalent) via liboqs:\n\n- pq-shield: CLI for keygen/sign/verify using ML-DSA-65\n- pq-shield-audit: validates key sizes and enforces 0600 permissions on private keys\n- C++20, CMake build, ctest integration\n\nThis is purely additive; no consensus changes. Intended as a foundation for\npost-quantum signature experimentation ahead of cryptographically relevant\nquantum computers threatening ECDSA/secp256k1.\n\nRequires liboqs built with ML-DSA enabled. See contrib/pq-shield/README.md\nfor build and usage instructions.",
